<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Be Thou my wisdom, and Thou my true Word;</l><l>I ever with Thee and Thou with me, Lord;</l><l>Thou my great Father and I, Thy true son;</l><l>Thou in me dwelling, and I with Thee one.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Riches I heed not, nor man’s empty praise;</l><l>Thou mine inheritance, now and always;</l><l>Thou and Thou only, first in my heart;</l><l>O King of glory, my treasure Thou art.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O King of glory, my victory won;</l><l>Rule and reign in me ’til Thy will be done;</l><l>Heart of my own heart, whatever befall;</l><l>Still be my vision, O Ruler of all.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
